data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call-32dda4ed-caee-4c9b-9288-3228e794c710","output":{"output":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"b741725ef3dcd816960b8bfa8859e1a72b5c68ca\",\"date\":\"2026-04-28T15:13:10+05:30\",\"message\":\"Apply standard OpenMRS MPL license headers (#162)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"b52412a0a7925469183c2590937d6720228f9ec6\",\"date\":\"2026-04-01T20:34:56+05:30\",\"message\":\"Payments should be associated with a cashier (#155)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* feat: add cashier (Provider) field to Payment model and HBM mapping\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* feat: add Liquibase migration for provider_id and error message key\\n\\n* feat: validate that new payments have an associated cashier\\n\\n* test: set cashier on payment in BillServiceImplTest\\n\\n* feat: auto-set cashier on payment from authenticated user; expose in REST representation\\n\\n* fix: run cashier validation before line-item DB query to avoid Hibernate auto-flush\\n\\nSwapped order so validateNewPaymentsHaveCashier runs before\\nvalidateLineItemsNotModified. The latter triggers a DB query that causes\\nHibernate to auto-flush transient payments, assigning them IDs and making\\nthe id==null check ineffective.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Allow client to set cashier\\n\\n* Update liquibase\\n\\n* test: move validator tests to BillValidatorTest and add voided payment edge case\\n\\nRelocates payment-cashier and line-item validation tests from\\nBillServiceImplTest to BillValidatorTest so each test class covers its\\nown layer. Adds validate_shouldTolerateVoidedNewPaymentWithNoCashier to\\ncover the voided-payment branch in BillValidator.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* test: verify BillValidator cashier check is triggered via saveBill; require cashier in payment test\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\n- Delegate getCurrentCashier() to ProviderUtil.getCurrentProvider() to remove duplication\\n- Migrate PaymentResourceTest from JUnit4 to JUnit5\\n- Add trailing newline to liquibase.xml\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\n- Fix mixed tabs/spaces indentation in liquibase changeset\\n- Add null/blank UUID check in PaymentResource.setCashier\\n- Improve error message accuracy in BillResource\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"7dfc3af97f42e94050d309742e38b580d3d8870e\",\"date\":\"2026-03-05T20:18:46+05:30\",\"message\":\"Revert \\\"O3-5197: Each payment should have an associated Cashier\\\" (#147)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"edd63790481fe565d8dbeb767a1ac8f29a1fb636\",\"date\":\"2026-03-04T11:07:07+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5197: Each payment should have an associated Cashier (#109)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"3d8ad72ffbeead74eee8f1ea49c804c085e523ea\",\"date\":\"2026-02-05T15:57:02+05:30\",\"message\":\"Apply Maven Formatter Changes (#102)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"1adef07860790f1d3f989321f93a1db1aedce16c\",\"date\":\"2026-01-17T06:18:43+05:30\",\"message\":\"Migrate PaymentModeService to OpenMRS Service (#86)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Migrate PaymentModeService to OpenMRS Service\\n\\n* Support getAll\\n\\n* Fix minor issues\\n\\n* update retirePaymentMode_shouldRetirePaymentMode test\\n\\n* Add includeAll support\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"2960184f9298f3f139c0ce2740e3910907dd5be9\",\"date\":\"2025-12-09T19:37:57+05:30\",\"message\":\"Migrate the BillService to OpenMRSService (#77)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"e1153d7b5cd307bdeb9d0a874c3ef8d282c7ed0a\",\"date\":\"2025-12-03T18:52:25+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5246: Fixing the payments issue Post addition of Pending state check (#72)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"4a26b524d8a68ed3f0c4068a5a6a3d843cc6aba2\",\"date\":\"2025-11-18T19:07:13+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5215: Enable Custom Representation for BillLineItemResource and PaymentResource (#62)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"ef3ea50e2ae5276e4dc660ffec9387cba8a795ed\",\"date\":\"2024-05-06T10:22:57+03:00\",\"message\":\"Receipt endpoint functionality and renaming of package from cashier to billing. (#5)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* O3-2958: Billing backend - Updated artefacts name from cashier to billing and updated snapshot repositories\\r\\n\\r\\n* Renamed packages from org/openmrs/module/cashier/ to org/openmrs/module/billing/\\r\\n\\r\\n* Added itextpdf dependency and receipt endpoint. The receipt endpoint provides functionality to generate and download a receipt in pdf\\r\\n\\r\\n---------\\r\\n\\r\\nCo-authored-by: Amos Laboso <alaboso@uonbi.ac.ke>\",\"authorName\":\"Amos Laboso\",\"authorEmail\":\"amos.laboso@gmail.com\"}],\"totalCount\":10}"}}

