data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call-3a2ea8dd-e491-4571-9a2e-834b58d7996f","output":{"output":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"15e5e4cf71392d4d2235191f24bd4a5a264f0dae\",\"date\":\"2026-06-02T12:37:02+05:30\",\"message\":\"Show discounts and refunds on bill receipts (#180)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Show discounts and refunds on bill receipts\\n\\n- Receipt now shows line-scoped discounts under each line item, plus Subtotal / Total Discount / Total in the totals block\\n  - New Refund section lists completed refunds with their reason\\n  - Due-amount math accounts for refunds\\n  - Fix NPE in Bill.synchronizeBillStatus() when payments is null\\n  - Add Liquibase 009b to drop orphaned payment_status column when both columns exist\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Use StringUtils.abbreviate\\n\\n* Drop trimming the refund reason\\n\\n* Fix due amount math\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"745c5878a82138cf6208239973c18f71fc05f1c2\",\"date\":\"2026-05-27T17:57:00+05:30\",\"message\":\"Add refundStatus filter to GET /bill and expose refunds in bill representation (#178)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Add refundStatus filter to GET /bill and expose refunds in bill representation\\n\\nAdds a refundStatus query parameter to GET /ws/rest/v1/cashier/bill so callers\\ncan filter bills by the status of their (non-voided) refunds. Supports\\ncomma-separated values mapping to the RefundStatus enum. Also surfaces the bill's\\nrefunds in the default and full REST representations.\\n\\nBillSearch gains a refundStatuses list.\\nHibernateBillDAO filters via an EXISTS subquery on non-voided BillRefund rows.\\nBill gains getActiveRefunds() to exclude voided rows from the representation.\\nBillResource parses the param and rejects unknown values with InvalidSearchException (400).\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Fix Sonar issues: extract constants and reduce cognitive complexity\\n\\n- Add FIELD_STATUS and FIELD_VOIDED constants to HibernateBillDAO to\\n  avoid duplicated string literals flagged by Sonar\\n- Extract patient-name lookup into buildPatientNamePredicate() to bring\\n  buildBillSearchPredicate cognitive complexity within the 15 limit\\n- Extract parseDiscountStatuses() and parseRefundStatuses() helpers in\\n  BillResource to bring buildBillSearchFromRequest within the 15 limit\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Guard refund data behind View Bill Refunds privilege\\n\\n- @PropertyGetter(\\\"refunds\\\") returns empty list when caller lacks VIEW_REFUNDS,\\n  preventing bypass of BillRefundService's @Authorized check via the bill representation\\n- refundStatus filter param now calls Context.requirePrivilege(VIEW_REFUNDS) before\\n  processing, blocking privilege-less callers from inferring refund activity\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Fix test: mock VIEW_REFUNDS privilege in getActiveRefunds_shouldExcludeVoidedRefunds\\n\\nThe static Context mock defaulted hasPrivilege() to false, causing the\\nprivilege guard to short-circuit and return an empty list before the\\nvoided-refund filter could run.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Fix test: mock VIEW_REFUNDS privilege in getActiveRefunds_shouldReturnEmptyWhenBillHasNoRefunds\\n\\nTest was passing because the privilege check short-circuited and returned\\nan empty list, not because the bill had no refunds. Added the privilege\\nmock so the test validates the actual no-refunds case.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"1dee616c219772026e79dddd7a80e57e6ea35c2d\",\"date\":\"2026-05-19T17:28:06+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5421: Associate bills with patient visits (#172)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (feat) Associate bills with patient visits\\n\\nAdds an optional visit association to Bill so bills can be linked to the\\nvisit they were generated during. The visit can be supplied explicitly\\nvia the REST API, is auto-populated from a patient's single active visit\\non create, and is auto-set from an order's encounter when a bill is\\ngenerated from orders. Bills can also be filtered by visitUuid.\\n\\n* Fix Patient mock failure on Java 21\\n\\nMockito's inline mock-maker cannot modify the full Patient class\\nhierarchy on Java 21. Use real Patient instances since the tests never\\nstub methods on them.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace Order mocks with real instances for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nMockito's inline mock-maker cannot instrument the full Order class\\nhierarchy on Java 21, causing TestOrderBillingStrategyTest to fail with\\n\\\"Mockito cannot mock this class: class org.openmrs.Order\\\". Use real\\nOrder/Encounter/Visit/Provider instances wired via setters instead.\\n\\nAlso fixes stale setPaymentStatus calls in BillServiceImplTest left over\\nfrom the BillLineItemStatus rename in e54193f.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace CashPoint mock with real instance for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nSame root cause as 4b75bc5: Mockito's inline mock-maker cannot\\ninstrument BaseOpenmrsMetadata's class hierarchy on Java 21.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace BillLineItem mock with real instance for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nLast remaining mock that fails under Java 21's inline mock-maker. With\\nthis, the visit-association tests use real instances throughout.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Validate bill visit association\\n\\n* Refactor bill resource save setup\\n\\n* Add bill visit index\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e54193f25d8b3064aa9d6e407f456f9a10909551\",\"date\":\"2026-05-15T20:06:17+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5422: Introduce a dedicated `BillLineItemStatus` (#170)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"71fc613004aa8313e0d01db46c298916d8a90d48\",\"date\":\"2026-05-12T20:44:10+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5413: Enable Refund Requests and Approval for Paid Bills (#167)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* O3-5413: Enable Refund Requests and Approval for Paid Bills\\n\\n  - New bill_refund table + JPA-mapped BillRefund entity (FK to bill, optional line item, audit fields)\\n  - RefundStatus enum: REQUESTED → APPROVED → COMPLETED (or → REJECTED)\\n  - BillRefundService / DAO / BillRefundValidator / REST resource at /billing/billRefund\\n  - New BillStatus values: REFUND_REQUESTED, REFUNDED, PARTIALLY_REFUNDED\\n  - 4 privileges: Request / Approve / Complete / View Bill Refunds\\n  - billing.refundEnabled feature flag\\n\\n* Update `BillRefundService` active refund criteria and fix indentation in `liquibase.xml`\\n\\n- Exclude `COMPLETED` refunds from active criteria in `BillRefundService` to clarify refund status lifecycle.\\n- Adjust indentation for `<createTable>` in `liquibase.xml` for consistency.\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"da2f5958f52b2e0b8999f37ed3a5a86797a80137\",\"date\":\"2026-05-07T19:37:06+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3 5417: Bill Discount Management with Audit Trail (#160)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Bill Discount\\n\\n* Add tests and fix mapping for BillDiscount functionality\\n\\n* Refactor `saveBillDiscount` method placement across DAO and service layers\\n\\n* Support multiple discounts per bill and add `getActiveDiscount` functionality\\n\\n* Refactor BillDiscountValidator to use predefined set for eligible statuses\\n\\n* Add Line Item Discount\\n\\n* Fix issues\\n\\n* Fix issues\\n\\n* Apply standard OpenMRS MPL license headers across billing module files\\n\\n* Refactor discount logic to dynamically compute discount amounts and remove persisted `discount_amount` field\\n\\n* Refactor `BillDiscountValidator` to handle self-exclusion and enforce validation on updates, add regression tests\\n\\n* Add `getActiveDiscounts` method to `Bill` and update REST representation to exclude voided discounts\\n\\n* Update `Bill` REST representation to include active discounts and exclude voided discounts\\n\\n* Allow voided discounts to bypass validation rules and enforce required `bill` query parameter for discount search\\n\\n* Add `DiscountStatus` to manage discount approval workflow and update related logic, validations, and tests\\n\\n* Refactor: Remove redundant blank lines across billing module files, improve readability in tests, services, DAOs, and REST resources\\n\\n* Validate `APPROVED/REJECTED` discount reversal with privilege check, enforce non-null entity validation in REST setters, and ensure non-negative total in `Bill`.\\n\\n* Remove redundant blank lines in `Bill` model and `BillDiscountResource` class.\\n\\n* Implement discount status validation, enforce drift guard for excessive discounts, and update related tests and services\\n\\n* Add log warning for discount drift, enhance null validation, and improve REST conversion handling\\n\\n- Annotated `Bill` with `@Slf4j` for logging support.\\n- Added `addDiscount` method with null validation for discounts in `Bill`.\\n- Logged warnings for discount drift in bill processing.\\n- Simplified `getDiscountAmount` documentation in `BillDiscount`.\\n- Enhanced validation messages and handling in `BillDiscountValidator`, including concurrent row checks.\\n- Improved `BigDecimal` conversion error handling in `BillDiscountResource` with meaningful exception messages.\\n- Updated `BillResource` to explicitly exclude discounts in creatable properties.\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"b741725ef3dcd816960b8bfa8859e1a72b5c68ca\",\"date\":\"2026-04-28T15:13:10+05:30\",\"message\":\"Apply standard OpenMRS MPL license headers (#162)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"ac11c886ace30365aba01b7ccdddd1b92494e950\",\"date\":\"2026-02-03T13:29:51+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5394: Bill line items should get marked as paid when bill is paid (#97)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Bill line items should get marked as paid when bill is paid\\n\\n* Update test\\n\\n* Remove unnecessary else\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"c01f7c3a41e3e47a34dfef187fd2a56aaaabb899\",\"date\":\"2025-12-24T01:12:22+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5295: Fix BillValidator not getting called when saving a Bill (#80)\",\"refs\":\"origin/O3-5284-Bug-Report-Cannot-Edit-Quantity-for-Free-Items-Price-0\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Ian <ian.c.bacher@gmail.com>\\n\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"2960184f9298f3f139c0ce2740e3910907dd5be9\",\"date\":\"2025-12-09T19:37:57+05:30\",\"message\":\"Migrate the BillService to OpenMRSService (#77)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"e1153d7b5cd307bdeb9d0a874c3ef8d282c7ed0a\",\"date\":\"2025-12-03T18:52:25+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5246: Fixing the payments issue Post addition of Pending state check (#72)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"715c78c1b13c2e03ee040a5041b60befef20e340\",\"date\":\"2025-11-24T22:11:27+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5200: Bill should allow modifications only in pending state (#64)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"160e8fd33f6c4ef03e70d15e1810b90a7941f408\",\"date\":\"2025-11-06T01:25:24-05:00\",\"message\":\"BillableService and CashierItemPrice should be metadata (#49)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* BillabeService and CashierItemPrice are metadata and should be treated as such\\n\\n* Fixes from code review\\n\\n* Remove unused imports across project\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a97416d3f8a29cde8cb5058b51dda6d6d1fd4849\",\"date\":\"2024-08-28T10:23:54+03:00\",\"message\":\"(Enhancement) Correctly handle bill status and payment transactions (#12)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"AJAL ODORA JONATHAN\",\"authorEmail\":\"43242517+ODORA0@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"ef3ea50e2ae5276e4dc660ffec9387cba8a795ed\",\"date\":\"2024-05-06T10:22:57+03:00\",\"message\":\"Receipt endpoint functionality and renaming of package from cashier to billing. (#5)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* O3-2958: Billing backend - Updated artefacts name from cashier to billing and updated snapshot repositories\\r\\n\\r\\n* Renamed packages from org/openmrs/module/cashier/ to org/openmrs/module/billing/\\r\\n\\r\\n* Added itextpdf dependency and receipt endpoint. The receipt endpoint provides functionality to generate and download a receipt in pdf\\r\\n\\r\\n---------\\r\\n\\r\\nCo-authored-by: Amos Laboso <alaboso@uonbi.ac.ke>\",\"authorName\":\"Amos Laboso\",\"authorEmail\":\"amos.laboso@gmail.com\"}],\"totalCount\":15}"}}

