data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"` is PR **#155, \"Payments should"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" be associated with a cashier\"**"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" (commit `b52412a0"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"a7925469183c2590937d672"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"0228f9ec6`, "}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"2026-04-01). It"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" added a mandatory `cashier` (an"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" OpenMRS `Provider`) to every new"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" payment, so each payment row now records who took"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" the money. It was made to fix the gap"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" that a payment previously had no notion of who processed"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" it — and notably it is the *second* attempt"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":": the first, PR #109 /"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" O3-5197 (\"Each payment should have an"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" associated Cashier\", commit `edd63790481"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"fe565d8dbeb767a1ac8"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"f29a1fb636`),"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" was reverted in PR #147 ("}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"commit `7dfc3af97"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"f42e94050d309742e38b"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"580d3d8870e`)"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" and then re-landed in #155.\n\n**"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"What changed**\n\n1. **Model**"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" — `Payment` gained a `cash"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ier` field of type `org.openmrs"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".Provider` @file:{github.com/openmrs"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"/openmrs-module-billing::"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"api/src/main/java/org/openm"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"rs/module/billing/api/model/P"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ayment.java:48-49}, alongside the existing"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" `amount` and `amountTendered"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"`.\n2. **Persistence** — a"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" `provider_id` column was added to"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" the payment table with an FK to `provider"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"` @file:{github.com/openmrs/open"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"mrs-module-billing::omod/src/main/resources"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"/liquibase.xml:367-"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"367}.\n3. **Server-side defaulting"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"** — when a bill is saved through"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" REST, any new payment with no cash"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ier inherits the authenticated user's provider"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" record. `setBillPayments`"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" does this once per save and throws a"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" `RestClientException` if the logged"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"-in user has no provider @file:{github.com"}

