data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"Validator.java:99-102}) to payments"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" where `getId() == null` and `voided"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" == false`, so **legacy payments"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" written before the column existed stay valid**.\n\n"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"**Why the ordering inside the validator matters**\n\n"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"`validateNewPaymentsHaveCashier` is called"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" before `validateLineItemsNotModified` @"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"file:{github.com/openmrs/open"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"mrs-module-billing::api/src/main/java"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"/org/openmrs/module/b"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"illing/validator/BillValidator.java:"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"50-51}. That order is the whole"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" point of the trap the PR had to fix: the"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" line-item check runs a DB query, which makes"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" Hibernate auto-flush the transient payments"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":", assign them IDs, and thereby defeat the `payment"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".getId() == null` test — so"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" the cashier requirement would silently stop firing. If"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" you reorder those two lines, the"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" validation regresses.\n\n```mermaid\n---\n"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"title: \"Bill payment: cashier assignment"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"\"\n---\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant UI"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" as Billing UI\n    participant BR"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" as BillResource\n    participant BV as BillValidator\n"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"    participant DB as Database\n    UI->"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":">BR: POST /billing/b"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ill with payments\n    BR->>"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"BR: setBillPayments, default cashier from"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" current provider\n    BR->>BV: save"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"Bill triggers validation\n    BV->>BV:"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" validateNewPaymentsHaveCashier first"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"\n    BV->>BV: then"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" validateLineItemsNotModified, may auto"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"-flush\n    BV-->>BR: reject"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" if new payment has no cashier\n    BR->"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":">DB: persist bill and payments with provider_id\n"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"```\n\nOn the client side, `open"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"mrs-esm-billing-app` already"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" expects this shape: `Payment` carries"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" a `cashier: Provider` @"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"file:{github.com/openmrs/openmrs-es"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"m-billing-app::src/types/index"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".ts:36-36}, and the"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" payload type sends the cashier UUID as"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" a string @file:{github.com/open"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"mrs/openmrs-esm-b"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"illing-app::src/types/index.ts:"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"253-255}, so callers can either"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" supply it or let the backend fill it in from"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" the session. The same frontend also has a"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" configured default cashier provider UUID @file:{github.com"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"/openmrs/openmrs-esm"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"-billing-app::src/config-schema"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".ts:73-74}.\n\nOne caveat"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" on sourcing: pull requests for `openmrs-mod"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ule-billing` were never ingested into"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" my index, so I could not read the"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" PR bodies or review comments for #109"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":", #147 or #155 — the"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" \"why\" above comes from the commit"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" messages and bodies, the reverted/re"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"-landed commit pairs, and the code itself, not"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" from the ticket text. The O3-519"}

